GENERATE exercise-oracle derive {dir}/../tests/fixtures/nj03-exercise-oracle/derive-oracle.mjs generate OUT
GENERATE exercise-oracle-en derive {dir}/../tests/fixtures/nj03-exercise-oracle/derive-oracle-en.mjs generate OUT
